@inject Licitaciones.Application.TiposCambio.ITipoCambioAppService TipoCambioServicio
@inject IConfiguration Configuracion
@{
    var tipoCambioActivo = await TipoCambioServicio.ObtenerActivoAsync();
    var apiBaseUrl = Configuracion["ApiBaseUrl"] ?? "/api";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - Sistema de Gestión de Licitaciones</title>
    <script type="importmap"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/Licitaciones.Web.styles.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body data-crc-por-usd="@(tipoCambioActivo?.CRCporUSD.ToString(System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) ?? "")"
      data-fecha-vigencia-tipo-cambio="@(tipoCambioActivo?.FechaVigencia.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd") ?? "")">
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-toggleable-sm bg-body border-bottom box-shadow mb-3" data-bs-theme="auto">
            <div class="container-fluid">
                <a class="navbar-brand" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Licitaciones</a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target=".navbar-collapse" aria-controls="navbarSupportedContent"
                        aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Mostrar/ocultar navegación">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="navbar-collapse collapse d-lg-inline-flex justify-content-between">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav flex-grow-1">
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Inicio</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" asp-area="" asp-controller="Licitaciones" asp-action="Index">Licitaciones</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" asp-area="" asp-controller="Proveedores" asp-action="Index">Proveedores</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" asp-area="" asp-controller="Ofertas" asp-action="Index">Ofertas</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" asp-area="" asp-controller="NivelesAprobacion" asp-action="Index">Niveles de aprobación</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" asp-area="" asp-controller="TiposCambio" asp-action="Index">Tipo de cambio</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" href="@apiBaseUrl/swagger" target="_blank" rel="noopener">API (Swagger)</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <button id="toggle-moneda" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Alternar entre colones y dólares">Ver en $ USD</button>
                        <button id="toggle-tema" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Alternar modo claro/oscuro">🌓 Tema</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <div class="container">
        <main role="main" class="pb-3">
            @if (TempData["Mensaje"] is string mensajeExito)
            {
                <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
                    @mensajeExito
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Cerrar"></button>
                </div>
            }
            @if (TempData["Error"] is string mensajeError)
            {
                <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
                    @mensajeError
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Cerrar"></button>
                </div>
            }
            @RenderBody()
        </main>
    </div>

    <footer class="border-top footer text-muted">
        <div class="container">
            &copy; 2026 - Sistema de Gestión de Licitaciones - Universidad Técnica Nacional
        </div>
    </footer>
    <script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
